    - '@defra/forms-engine-plugin > @defra/interactive-map > *':
        reason: 'Rechecked 2026-10-05 on forms-engine-plugin@4.23.0: Docusaurus@3.10.2 > webpack-dev-server@5.2.6 > launch-editor@2.14.1 > shell-quote@1.10.0. The documentation dev server is never run by grants-ui. Fixed shell-quote@1.11.0 was published 2026-09-29T02:34:24Z and clears the seven-day cooldown on 2026-10-06 after 02:34 UTC; add the override and remove this exception then.'
